			Palestine and Babylon, Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτφαλτος</span>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 15, 51, § 178
			sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 5, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 1, 2,
